.SS "template<\fBlength_t\fP L, typename \fBT\fP , \fBqualifier\fP Q> \fBGLM_FUNC_DECL\fP \fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBT\fP, \fBQ\fP > glm::reflect (\fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBT\fP, \fBQ\fP > const & I, \fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBT\fP, \fBQ\fP > const & N)"
For the incident vector I and surface orientation N, returns the reflection direction : result = I - 2\&.0 * dot(N, I) * N\&.
.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIL\fP An integer between 1 and 4 included that qualify the dimension of the vector\&. 
.br
\fIT\fP Floating-point scalar types\&.
.RE
.PP
